          "**Non-haem iron** (cereals, pulses, greens) is ferric and must be reduced to **ferrous (Fe2+) by duodenal cytochrome b (DcytB) and vitamin C** before the **DMT1 transporter** takes it into the enterocyte - why vitamin C helps and antacids hurt. [Harrison 22e]",
